#chip tiny202, 20

'Repeat For test (Change 1654): Timeout idiom: If Flag Then Exit Repeat, then Wait 5 ms in the body
'Expect: compiles, and the whole Repeat For construct runs exactly 2,000,000 clock cycles
'(checked by simulating the generated assembly instruction by instruction)

#option explicit
Dim X As Byte
Dim Flag As Bit

Repeat for 100 ms
    If Flag = 1 Then
        Exit Repeat
    End If
    Wait 5 ms
    X = X + 1
End Repeat
Do
Loop
